WEBVTT

00:13:27.469 --> 00:13:31.807
But we won't achieve
a climate-safe future without peace.

00:13:32.599 --> 00:13:33.851
And to build peace,

00:13:33.892 --> 00:13:36.353
we need to shake things up
in international politics

00:13:36.353 --> 00:13:38.730
and in the way that we do
business and economics.

00:13:39.022 --> 00:13:40.566
So where do we start?

00:13:40.607 --> 00:13:43.986
I'd like to offer the scaffolding
of a plan in four different baskets.

00:13:44.361 --> 00:13:46.238
First, science.

00:13:46.905 --> 00:13:50.993
Science can tell us exactly where
it is safe to mine and where it isn't,

00:13:50.993 --> 00:13:52.536
from an ecological perspective.

00:13:52.953 --> 00:13:55.038
Where it is not safe to mine,

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:59.167
we need to act as though
these minerals did not exist

00:13:59.209 --> 00:14:01.003
and establish protected areas